# Allowlist: the build context contains only what the Dockerfile copies, so
# local secrets (.env), virtualenvs, caches, and git history never reach it.
*
!Dockerfile
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!requirements/
!requirements/build.txt
!requirements/runtime.txt
!src/
!alembic.ini
!migrations/
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info
